This repository bundles two data lists, used by the API's form checks
(apps/api/src/vetting/, written by scripts/vetting-data.mjs):

- US populated places from GeoNames (https://www.geonames.org/), licensed
  under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
  The list keeps only place names by state, normalized for matching.

- Temporary-mailbox domains from the disposable-email-domains project
  (https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains),
  dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0.
